SUMMARY:AYPROS Night at UNC Asheville Men's Basketball
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\n**Bulldogs basketball.
  An entire section reserved for AYPROS. Our first beer courtesy of Bear's 
 Smokehouse BBQ. Commemorative cups. A special shoutout during the game. An
 d a group photo ON THE COURT afterward. All with tickets for just $5!**\nW
 e're teaming up with UNC Asheville Athletics for a special AYPROS Night at
  Kimmel Arena on **Wednesday\, November 18**\, as the Bulldogs take on the
  Tennessee Tech Golden Eagles!\nOur friends at UNC Asheville are rolling o
 ut the welcome mat for Asheville's young professionals. We've got our own 
 reserved seating in Section 6 so we can cheer on the Bulldogs together\, a
 nd UNC Asheville is planning a special **AYPROS announcement over the aren
 a's PA system during the game.** Even better? After the final buzzer\, we'
 ll have the opportunity to head down onto the basketball court for an offi
 cial AYPROS group photo!\nHow often do you get to walk onto the court at K
 immel Arena? We're hoping to fill Section 6 with as many AYPROS members as
  possible\, so grab your friends\, coworkers\, significant others\, or any
 one who enjoys a great night of college basketball. Whether you're a die-h
 ard Bulldogs fan or haven't been to a game in years\, this is a pretty gre
 at excuse to get out\, meet some new people\, and show some love for our h
 ometown team.\n\n### And There's More! Your First Beer Is on Bear's!\n\nOu
 r friends at **Bear's Smokehouse BBQ** are making AYPROS Night even better
  by purchasing the **first beer for our AYPROS attendees (21+)!**\nA huge 
 thank you to **Cheryl Antoncic-Suess and the entire Bear's Smokehouse BBQ 
 team** for generously stepping up to treat our crew. Bear's operates conce
 ssions at Kimmel Arena\, and we're grateful they're helping us make this a
  special night for Asheville's young professionals.\nAYPROS attendees 21 a
 nd older will receive a drink voucher redeemable at Bear's concession stan
 ds. Just bring your ID!\nAnd that's not all. There will also be **special 
 commemorative cups given out that evening**.\nBetween the game\, our reser
 ved section\, a beer courtesy of Bear's\, the commemorative cups\, our in-
 game recognition\, and the opportunity to get everyone together on the cou
 rt afterward\, this is shaping up to be a pretty special evening!\n\n### T
 he First 20 AYPROS Attendees Get In FREE!\n\nThat's right! **AYPROS is pur
 chasing tickets for the first 20 AYPROS attendees who arrive at the game.*
 * We're covering the cost of admission for our early arrivals as one more 
 reason to come out and join us.\nAnd if you're not among the first 20? **T
 ickets are only $5 (normally $25) with our exclusive AYPROS discount code.
 ** That's an 80% discount on Division I college basketball\, with a few AY
 PROS-only perks thrown in for good measure.\nWant to make sure you've got 
 a seat? You can purchase your $5 ticket in advance using the instructions 
 below.\n\n### Game Day Details\n\n* **Date:** Wednesday\, November 18\, 20
 26\n* **Time:** 6:30 PM (doors open at 5:30 PM)\n* **Matchup:** UNC Ashevi
 lle Bulldogs vs. Tennessee Tech Golden Eagles\n* **Location:** Kimmel Aren
 a\, Sherrill Center at UNC Asheville\, 227 Campus Drive\, Asheville\, NC 2
 8804\n* **AYPROS Seating:** Section 6\n* **Tickets:** Just $5 with promo c
 ode **AYPROS**\n* **First Beer:** Courtesy of Bear's Smokehouse BBQ for AY
 PROS attendees ages 21+\n* **Special Extras:** Commemorative cup giveaway\
 , in-game AYPROS recognition\, and an official postgame group photo on the
  court\n* **What to Wear:** Your best BULLDOGS BLUE! We want to see a sea 
 of blue in our section and in our group photo. (Not sure what Bulldog Blue
  is? [Check out the university's style guide here](https://www.unca.edu/co
 mmunication/branding/graphic-standards/)!)\n\n### How to Get Your $5 Ticke
 ts\n\n1. Click **[Purchase Your AYPROS Tickets Here](https://university-of
 -north-carolina-asheville-ilh9.vivenushop.com/event/6a79dfcabe06b624350591
 28/6ab535875a3b4d739107f1a1)**.\n2. Select "Buy Tickets" and enter promo c
 ode **AYPROS** when prompted.\n3. Choose your seats in Section 6 and compl
 ete your purchase.\n\nWe've reserved Section 6 specifically for AYPROS\, a
 nd we'd love nothing more than to fill it! Tickets are available directly 
 through UNC Asheville Athletics\, so be sure to purchase yours and encoura
 ge your friends to do the same.\n\n### Parking & Arrival Information\n\nPa
 rking for UNC Asheville basketball games is included in your game ticket\,
  so there is no additional parking charge.\n**Important:** UNC Asheville r
 equires all campus visitors to register their vehicles\, even when parking
  is included with admission.\n\n* **Where to Park:** Public campus lots P8
 \, P10\, P11\, P12\, P14\, P15\, and P16 are within walking distance of Ki
 mmel Arena.\n* **Reserved Parking:** The P9 parking deck adjacent to the a
 rena is reserved for qualifying Bulldog Club members\, with accessible par
 king available for properly permitted vehicles.\n* **Parking Registration:
 ** [Register your vehicle here](https://unca.aimsparking.com/) before arri
 ving. There is no additional charge for basketball game attendees.\n* **Ar
 ena Entry:** Doors open at 5:30 PM\, one hour before tip-off.\n* **Campus 
 Map:** [View UNC Asheville's parking information and campus map](https://u
 ncabulldogs.com/sports/2025/8/21/parking-on-campus/).\n\nWe recommend arri
 ving a little early to find parking\, get settled in Section 6\, and take 
 advantage of everything planned for the evening.\n\n### Let's Fill Section
  6!\n\nA huge thank you to **Kassi Butcher and the UNC Asheville Athletics
  team** for helping put this evening together\, and to **Cheryl Antoncic S
 uess and Bear's Smokehouse BBQ** for treating our attendees to their first
  beer!\n**Now let's show UNC Asheville what the AYPROS community can do!**
  We're hoping to pack Section 6\, make some noise for our hometown Bulldog
 s\, and get as many of us as possible into that postgame photo. But we nee
 d you there to make it happen.\nGrab your $5 ticket\, send this invitation
  to a few friends\, and come dressed in your best Bulldogs blue. The more 
 of us who show up\, the better this night will be.\n**[GET YOUR $5 TICKETS
  TODAY!](https://university-of-north-carolina-asheville-ilh9.vivenushop.co
 m/event/6a79dfcabe06b62435059128/6ab535875a3b4d739107f1a1)**\nUse promo co
 de **AYPROS**\, and let's fill those stands!\n**GO UNC ASHEVILLE BULLDOGS!
 **\n**Thank you to UNC ASHEVILLE and Bear's BBQ for making this night poss
 ible and extra special for us.**
